            {
              "id": "art-body",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 9
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Transportation is a vital part of any business, ensuring that products are delivered safely and efficiently. Whether you operate in warehousing, logistics, or you have a smaller business looking to take transportation into your own hands, the right equipment can make all the difference. Trailers and truck bodies provide a reliable, secure way to move goods, protecting them from the elements and ensuring they arrive in top condition. Whether you’re upgrading an aging fleet or purchasing new equipment, investing in high-quality truck bodies and trailers is a smart business decision.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-investment",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Get the Most Out of Your Investment",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "investment"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-investment-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Upgrading to a new truck body can enhance your fleet’s efficiency and reliability. Modern truck bodies are designed with durability and innovation in mind, offering features that improve safety, streamline loading and unloading, and ensure compliance with industry regulations. With a well-built truck body, your fleet is better equipped to handle last-mile transportation needs while reducing downtime. Their efficient design and sturdy construction help minimize shipping costs while maximizing productivity, ensuring your business stays ahead in a competitive market.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-built",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Built to Last",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "built"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-built-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Durability is key when investing in new transportation equipment. Heavy-duty truck bodies are designed to withstand the demands of daily use while providing the efficiency and reliability your business needs. Purchasing a new tractor chassis ensures you have dependable equipment that requires fewer repairs, allowing you to focus on growing your business rather than dealing with costly maintenance. With more efficient design and sturdy construction, you can trust your fleet to complete final-mile deliveries with peace of mind.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-start",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Start Your Business on the Right Track",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "start"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-start-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If you’re building your business, investing in new dry freight truck bodies can set you up for long-term success. New truck bodies provide peace of mind, knowing that your fleet is dependable and won’t require frequent repairs or replacements. This means fewer unexpected costs and more resources to reinvest in other areas of your business. A reliable fleet can help you meet customer demands, improve operational efficiency, and establish your business as a trusted player in the industry.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-switch",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Switch Out Older Models for New Ones",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "switch"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-switch-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Ensuring that your trucks operate at peak performance is crucial for maintaining efficiency and safety. Older truck bodies can become a liability, requiring frequent repairs and increasing downtime. Over time, excessive maintenance costs can add up, making an old truck body more trouble than it’s worth.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "pull-switch-2-row",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "pull-switch-2",
                      "type": "column",
                      "props": {
                        "span": 12
                      },
                      "styles": {
                        "base": {
                          "borderTopWidth": 1,
                          "borderBottomWidth": 1,
                          "borderLeftWidth": 0,
                          "borderRightWidth": 0,
                          "borderStyle": "solid",
                          "borderColor": "line",
                          "paddingTop": 24,
                          "paddingBottom": 24,
                          "marginTop": 28,
                          "marginBottom": 28
                        }
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "pull-switch-2-text",
                          "type": "text",
                          "props": {
                            "text": "If your truck requires more repairs than usual or struggles to meet your operational demands, it may be time to replace it with a newer, more reliable dry freight truck body.",
                            "align": "left",
                            "width": "full"
                          },
                          "styles": {
                            "base": {
                              "fontSize": 22,
                              "fontWeight": "800",
                              "lineHeight": 1.4,
                              "textColor": "ink"
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-customize",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Customization Options for Your Fleet",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "customize"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-customize-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Every business has unique transportation needs, and choosing the right dry freight truck body can significantly impact efficiency. Many modern truck bodies offer customizable features such as secure tie-downs, LED lighting, fleet management systems, and more to enhance usability and convenience.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cards-customize-2",
                  "type": "card-lists",
                  "props": {
                    "variant": "numbered",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "title": "FEATURE",
                        "intro": "Secure tie-downs",
                        "points": []
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "FEATURE",
                        "intro": "LED lighting",
                        "points": []
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "FEATURE",
                        "intro": "Fleet management systems",
                        "points": []
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-customize-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Investing in a truck body that aligns with your specific cargo and operational needs ensures a smoother workflow and helps prevent unnecessary damage to goods. Customization also allows you to maximize storage capacity while keeping fuel efficiency and weight distribution in check.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-boost",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Give Your Business a Boost",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "boost"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-boost-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Your trucks are more than just transportation—they’re a representation of your business. A well-maintained, professional-looking fleet shows success, reliability, and efficiency to clients and partners. A brand-new dry freight truck body boosts your company’s image, such as the newly introduced <a href=\"https://www.hyundaitranslead.com/\">Hyundai Translead Anza</a>. With this addition to your fleet, you will make a positive impression wherever your trucks go. There’s nothing like a shiny new truck rolling down the highway, catching the attention of potential customers and reinforcing your brand’s credibility.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-choose",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Choose Sun State International for Your Equipment Needs",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "choose"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-choose-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At <a href=\"/\">Sun State International</a>, we offer a wide selection of <a href=\"https://www.international.com/\">International brand trucks</a>, high-quality <a href=\"https://www.hyundaitranslead.com/\">Hyundai Translead</a> truck bodies, and <a href=\"/store/inventory?type=trailer\">Globe and Hyundai trailers</a>. Our team is committed to helping you find the equipment that meets your business’s needs, providing expert guidance and top-tier customer service. We also offer flexible <a href=\"/financing\">financing options</a> to make your investment more manageable. <a href=\"/contact\">Contact us today</a> to learn more about our inventory, financing solutions, or to visit one of our locations to explore our trucks and trailers firsthand. Let us help you take your business further with reliable, high-performance equipment.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
